	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"入門者にオススメ！組み立ての順番を間違えても大丈夫！BANDAI SPIRITS公式の「パーツセパレーター」が登場！",
			"• プラモデルメーカーのノウハウを結集。手に馴染み、使い勝手の良い形状を実現。",
			"• 樹脂成形だからパーツを傷つけずに分解できる。",
			"• ピンを差し込んで押し出すことでもパーツの分割が可能。",
			"• ポリキャップにピンを差し込めば、挟み込む際につぶれにくい。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Recommended for beginners! It's okay if the assembly order is wrong! BANDAI SPIRITS official \"parts separator\" is now available!",
			"• Bringing together the know-how of plastic model manufacturers. It has a shape that fits comfortably in your hand and is easy to use.",
			"• Because it is resin molded, it can be disassembled without damaging the parts.",
			"• Parts can also be separated by inserting and pushing out pins.",
			"• If you insert a pin into the polycap, it won't get crushed when you pinch it."
		]
	},
